              "recommendation": "Percent-encode path parameters (quote(str(item_id), safe='')) in the generated template. In stream_to_file, check that the final response is 200 with an expected binary Content-Type before writing. Also CWE-918: URL-encode item_id (and stringify and validate the UUID parameters) before building the path. Also check the status code and the expected Content-Type before streaming the body to disk.",
              "cwe_id": "CWE-22",
              "snippet": "            url=f\"/{contract_id}/{order_id}/{item_id}/download\",",
              "symbol": "CosService.download_order_item_to_file",
              "declared_line": 447,
