              "recommendation": "Validate path parameters as UUIDs (UUID(str(v))) or percent-encode each segment with urllib.parse.quote(str(v), safe='') in the generated URL template. In the adapters, do not urljoin caller paths that resolve to a different scheme/host than base_url; reject or force them to be relative.",
